{"data":[{"author_id":"925446092669489154","created_at":"2026-10-15T12:43:23.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110713144548979152"],"id":"2110713144548979152","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":26,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"缠论里最容易被用错的一句话：背驰了，就该反手做。\n\n这是我见过新手交的最贵的一笔学费。📉\n\n先把结论放前面：\n背驰不等于反转。它只保证一件事——回拉。\n\n背驰的本质，是「离开段」和「进入段」的力度对比：同方向、同级别，后一段的推动力明显变小了（常看 MACD 黄白线回抽 + 红绿柱面积收缩）。","url":"https://x.com/InGodWeBelieveU/status/2110713144548979152"},{"author_id":"1685620377941364736","created_at":"2026-10-14T13:59:11.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110369832021664193"],"id":"2110369832021664193","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":225,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"根据《捍卫马克思》《货币战争和人民币战略》两套逻辑来讲目前中国金融市场的阵痛。\n\n很多人盯着美股新高、A 股新低，不断发问，为什么实体经济各有故事，资本市场却走出完全背离行情？\n因为资本市场是资本虚拟化的财富转移游戏，是全球化下国与国经济博弈的直接战场，绝非简单的实体经济镜像。","url":"https://x.com/zhishuzengzhang/status/2110369832021664193"},{"author_id":"923007331763392512","created_at":"2026-10-15T01:52:02.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110549225255916009"],"entities":{"urls":[{"description":"迅雷云盘","display_url":"pan.xunlei.com/s/VP1YlbvJksQp…","end":51,"expanded_url":"https://pan.xunlei.com/s/VP1YlbvJksQp56ylgxBi1XJUA1?pwd=b4yx","start":28,"status":200,"title":"迅雷","unwound_url":"https://pan.xunlei.com/s/VP1YlbvJksQp56ylgxBi1XJUA1?pwd=b4yx","url":"https://t.co/l9f3XKUJFV"}]},"id":"2110549225255916009","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":21708,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"😛🎊🌞\n【po文+po18+废文+AO3】合集\n\n🔗：\nhttps://t.co/l9f3XKUJFV\n\n作者合集：安诗鸢尾合集\n《这婚离不成了【快穿 】》作者：安诗鸢尾\n《双倍沦陷ABO》作者：安诗鸢尾\n《炮灰觊觎主角团的下场》作者：安诗鸢尾\n《笨蛋美人穿书后被bt盯上了》作者：安诗鸢尾","url":"https://x.com/myclejonson/status/2110549225255916009"},{"article":{"title":"好的写作到底是什么"},"author_id":"16681326","created_at":"2026-10-15T08:39:38.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110651803901784258"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/i/article/2110…","end":23,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/i/article/2110651664059273216","start":0,"status":404,"unwound_url":"https://x.com/i/article/2110651664059273216","url":"https://t.co/jdF4YGkNFe"}]},"id":"2110651803901784258","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":89,"impression_count":6008,"like_count":46,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":13},"text":"https://t.co/jdF4YGkNFe","url":"https://x.com/lifesinger/status/2110651803901784258"},{"author_id":"1585163772054081537","created_at":"2026-10-15T16:13:20.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110765979340857603"],"id":"2110765979340857603","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":20,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"《六祖坛经》「心平何劳持戒，行直何用修禅」，心本来就平正，不用刻意去守戒。它还说「善恶虽殊，本性无二」，善和恶看起来不同，背后的本性是一样的。人道规定的善良在天道意义上来说本身并不天然具有高一等的价值叙事，它也掺杂着人性中的贪嗔痴。执于善非大善，亦不是自然本真之法。老实人容易用“","url":"https://x.com/JamesPandaVC/status/2110765979340857603"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110543015442034688","3_2110543015433715712","3_2110543015542726656","3_2110543015546888192"]},"author_id":"1803349471771893765","created_at":"2026-10-15T01:27:27.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110543039798346101"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/JYEnNAEGtM","end":81,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/EllieEllie0077/status/2110543039798346101/photo/1","media_key":"3_2110543015442034688","start":58,"url":"https://t.co/JYEnNAEGtM"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/JYEnNAEGtM","end":81,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/EllieEllie0077/status/2110543039798346101/photo/1","media_key":"3_2110543015433715712","start":58,"url":"https://t.co/JYEnNAEGtM"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/JYEnNAEGtM","end":81,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/EllieEllie0077/status/2110543039798346101/photo/1","media_key":"3_2110543015542726656","start":58,"url":"https://t.co/JYEnNAEGtM"},{"display_url":"pic.x.com/JYEnNAEGtM","end":81,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/EllieEllie0077/status/2110543039798346101/photo/1","media_key":"3_2110543015546888192","start":58,"url":"https://t.co/JYEnNAEGtM"}]},"id":"2110543039798346101","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":4,"impression_count":1557,"like_count":80,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":30,"retweet_count":10},"text":"北京法海寺你去过吗？\n大雄宝殿内，一套明代宫廷壁画技艺登峰造极，其中佛坛背后扇面墙上的\"水月观音\"最教人移不开眼。 https://t.co/JYEnNAEGtM","url":"https://x.com/EllieEllie0077/status/2110543039798346101"},{"author_id":"1592938896161001472","created_at":"2026-10-14T01:00:34.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110173888437170474"],"entities":{"mentions":[{"end":57,"id":"10228272","start":49,"username":"YouTube"}],"urls":[{"description":"-币安广场/微博：高山说缠论-专注缠论交易系统教学多年-专注币圈/股票/黄金/原油实战操作-周一至周五早8点缠论解析早课-每周...","display_url":"youtu.be/7V9ULHUBx28?si…","end":45,"expanded_url":"https://youtu.be/7V9ULHUBx28?si=r9uwZsJ0AzpdZHsS","images":[{"height":360,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2110173892379873280/KqMGwLoK?format=jpg&name=orig","width":480},{"height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2110173892379873280/KqMGwLoK?format=jpg&name=150x150","width":150}],"start":22,"status":200,"title":"《高山说缠》-今日早课之缠论解析10.14","unwound_url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?si=r9uwZsJ0AzpdZHsS&v=7V9ULHUBx28&feature=youtu.be","url":"https://t.co/EjtERn6zh8"}]},"id":"2110173888437170474","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":42,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"《高山说缠》-今日早课之缠论解析10.14 https://t.co/EjtERn6zh8 来自 @YouTube","url":"https://x.com/yycl_gaoshan/status/2110173888437170474"},{"author_id":"925446092669489154","created_at":"2026-10-14T18:33:51.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110438954453418399"],"id":"2110438954453418399","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":45,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"缠论里常说的“级别”，和软件上的“30 分钟线”“日线”，\n是一回事吗？\n\n不完全是。\n我把它拆成三层来看：\n\n▌“级别”的三层意思\n① 定义层：靠“嵌套”\n🔹 中枢，由至少 𝟯 段“次级别走势类型”重叠构成\n🔹 本级别的走势类型，又由本级别的中枢和连接段组成\n🔹","url":"https://x.com/InGodWeBelieveU/status/2110438954453418399"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110398914884976641"]},"author_id":"925446092669489154","created_at":"2026-10-14T15:54:47.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110398924418597288"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/g6mNx96MeU","end":160,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/InGodWeBelieveU/status/2110398924418597288/photo/1","media_key":"3_2110398914884976641","start":137,"url":"https://t.co/g6mNx96MeU"}]},"id":"2110398924418597288","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":50,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"缠论解大盘SPY\n\n目前4小时K线结构比较典型，已经形成了两中枢上涨的结构。\n\n小c段明显与小b段形成了典型的背驰结构，通胀造成市场偏悲观，没有突破成功被重新拉回到中枢B结构中，继续中枢震荡。\n\n两个中枢A和B之间形成了扩张结构，升级到更大级别的中枢，有比较强的支撑作用。 https://t.co/g6mNx96MeU","url":"https://x.com/InGodWeBelieveU/status/2110398924418597288"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110183058611789824"]},"author_id":"1910907485554462720","created_at":"2026-10-14T01:37:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110183073942016084"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/5rHDlXtSpZ","end":175,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/Cycle_King1913/status/2110183073942016084/photo/1","media_key":"3_2110183058611789824","start":152,"url":"https://t.co/5rHDlXtSpZ"},{"display_url":"x.com/Cycle_King1913…","end":199,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/Cycle_King1913/status/2109584116433944617","start":176,"url":"https://t.co/ECg1d0G7cu"}]},"id":"2110183073942016084","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":32,"impression_count":3561,"like_count":43,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":5},"text":"📚 花姐带路，100天搞懂缠论 · DAY 03\n\n缠论第三课，一句话就够：\n\n中间那根是主角。\n\n三根K线站一排——\n🔺 中间最高 = 顶分型\n🔻 中间最低 = 底分型\n顶不是山尖，底不是山谷，\n中间整根最高或最低，才算数。\n别再只看一个尖了，\n90% 的人分型找错，都错在「只看最高点，不看整根」。 https://t.co/5rHDlXtSpZ https://t.co/ECg1d0G7cu","url":"https://x.com/Cycle_King1913/status/2110183073942016084"},{"author_id":"1529615280171028480","created_at":"2026-10-14T09:43:29.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110305483399795184"],"id":"2110305483399795184","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":36,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"发太多缠论技术分析被限流了？🥲\n\n我去，什么情况😳","url":"https://x.com/ThetaRider_L/status/2110305483399795184"},{"author_id":"1592938896161001472","created_at":"2026-10-15T02:21:01.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110556520945725711"],"entities":{"mentions":[{"end":57,"id":"10228272","start":49,"username":"YouTube"}],"urls":[{"description":"-币安广场/微博：高山说缠论-专注缠论交易系统教学多年-专注币圈/股票/黄金/原油实战操作-周一至周五早8点缠论解析早课-每周...","display_url":"youtu.be/IiW18pC5BLM?si…","end":45,"expanded_url":"https://youtu.be/IiW18pC5BLM?si=XIeRZyim9c20SvTL","images":[{"height":360,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2110556527652433920/BkICSmM1?format=jpg&name=orig","width":480},{"height":150,"url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2110556527652433920/BkICSmM1?format=jpg&name=150x150","width":150}],"start":22,"status":200,"title":"《高山说缠》-今日早课之缠论解析10.15","unwound_url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?si=XIeRZyim9c20SvTL&v=IiW18pC5BLM&feature=youtu.be","url":"https://t.co/UcEualTw0L"}]},"id":"2110556520945725711","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":40,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"《高山说缠》-今日早课之缠论解析10.15 https://t.co/UcEualTw0L 来自 @YouTube","url":"https://x.com/yycl_gaoshan/status/2110556520945725711"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110309171027648512"]},"author_id":"1592938896161001472","created_at":"2026-10-14T09:58:14.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110309193450459387"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/xcCeowU2jI","end":150,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/yycl_gaoshan/status/2110309193450459387/photo/1","media_key":"3_2110309171027648512","start":127,"url":"https://t.co/xcCeowU2jI"}]},"id":"2110309193450459387","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":43,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"加密市场多空继续厮杀\n全球市场都是萎靡不振\n今晚老美公布9月cpi数据\n感受行情起落的博弈魅力\n体验人性的贪婪与恐惧\n今晚19:00全网缠论公开课\n缠论拆解当下走势分类与买卖点\n锁定每周一三五免费公开课\n直播地址：微博关注《高山说缠论》\n点关注不迷路~ https://t.co/xcCeowU2jI","url":"https://x.com/yycl_gaoshan/status/2110309193450459387"},{"author_id":"925446092669489154","created_at":"2026-10-14T05:04:36.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110235299150266605"],"id":"2110235299150266605","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":23,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"缠论里，\"盘整\"不是\"没走势\"，\n\"趋势\"也不是\"涨了很多天\"。\n它们是两种不同的\"走势类型\"，各有结构门槛。\n\n▌误区 vs 事实\n\n✘ 误区：连涨很多天，就是上涨趋势\n✔ 事实：缠论的\"趋势\"要有结构：至少 𝟮 个同向、依次抬高（或降低）、彼此不重叠的中枢\n\n✘ 误区：横着走，就是没走势\n✔ 事实：只含 𝟭","url":"https://x.com/InGodWeBelieveU/status/2110235299150266605"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110173207114248192"]},"author_id":"2110055477413314560","created_at":"2026-10-14T00:58:27.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110173355647402269"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/FCf8mVCWIb","end":30,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/u32b7/status/2110173355647402269/photo/1","media_key":"3_2110173207114248192","start":7,"url":"https://t.co/FCf8mVCWIb"}]},"id":"2110173355647402269","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":27,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"缠论结构玩家 https://t.co/FCf8mVCWIb","url":"https://x.com/u32b7/status/2110173355647402269"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110573907279478784"]},"author_id":"1627691697143689216","created_at":"2026-10-15T03:31:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110574132601708550"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/6Mg7cOK7zD","end":54,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/oxlanhaili/status/2110574132601708550/photo/1","media_key":"3_2110573907279478784","start":31,"url":"https://t.co/6Mg7cOK7zD"}]},"id":"2110574132601708550","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":11,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"使用小资金，利用缠论二类买卖点，多空模式双向，自动量化小跑中 https://t.co/6Mg7cOK7zD","url":"https://x.com/oxlanhaili/status/2110574132601708550"},{"attachments":{"media_keys":["3_2110465814050779136"]},"author_id":"1125012600960327680","created_at":"2026-10-14T20:29:17.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110468003930534383"],"entities":{"cashtags":[{"end":14,"start":9,"tag":"intc"}],"urls":[{"display_url":"pic.x.com/ycNbG6xqMI","end":151,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/DeepbookTrader/status/2110468003930534383/photo/1","media_key":"3_2110465814050779136","start":128,"url":"https://t.co/ycNbG6xqMI"}]},"id":"2110468003930534383","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":68,"like_count":0,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"近十个交易日，以 $intc 为例，股价快速下破所有均线，这样的事情在 6 月至 7 月有过先例。\n有心人打开周线会发现，这不过是上次下跌的延续，符合缠论理论。\n如果没有对 7 月份以来交易的反思和记录，历史的悲剧一定会再次重演，但这次反弹账户是正收益。 https://t.co/ycNbG6xqMI","url":"https://x.com/DeepbookTrader/status/2110468003930534383"},{"author_id":"1455209006792728578","created_at":"2026-10-15T16:54:14.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110776274004164611"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/PeterPan1f/sta…","end":95,"expanded_url":"https://twitter.com/PeterPan1f/status/2110776088683249815","start":72,"url":"https://t.co/axlbKFskLh"}]},"id":"2110776274004164611","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":8,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"当然，如何正确地动，就是另外一回事情了。新手想学习直接缠论入手吧，我会慢慢地把我这10年来学缠的历程和认知的突破分享出来，助力有缘人少走弯路。 https://t.co/axlbKFskLh","url":"https://x.com/PeterPan1f/status/2110776274004164611"},{"author_id":"925446092669489154","created_at":"2026-10-14T14:00:15.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110370099165081736"],"id":"2110370099165081736","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":51,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"缠论里，“笔”和“线段”，\n不是一个小一个大那么简单。\n\n它们是两套不同的规则。\n\n▌笔 ⟷ 线段\n\n【组成】\n笔 ⟷ 连接相邻的顶分型、底分型\n线段 ⟷ 至少 𝟯 笔，且前三笔要有重叠区间\n\n【谁来判断终结】\n笔 ⟷ 反方向的分型\n线段 ⟷ “特征序列”（与线段方向相反的那些笔）出现分型","url":"https://x.com/InGodWeBelieveU/status/2110370099165081736"},{"author_id":"925446092669489154","created_at":"2026-10-14T05:17:04.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110238436237971776"],"id":"2110238436237971776","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":28,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"背驰告诉您\"可能要变了\"，\n区间套想回答的是：大概在哪里变？\n\n缠论里的\"区间套\"，思路像换显微镜倍率：\n先用低倍镜圈出视野，再用高倍镜一层层缩小范围。\n\n▌区间套，三层缩小\n\n① 大级别：先圈范围\n🔹 例如日线的某一段出现背驰迹象\n🔹 它只说明\"这一段力度在衰竭\"，转折点大概率在这一段的尾部附近","url":"https://x.com/InGodWeBelieveU/status/2110238436237971776"},{"author_id":"925446092669489154","created_at":"2026-10-15T17:26:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110784423339630840"],"id":"2110784423339630840","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":40,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"缠论学到最后，最难的功夫不是找买卖点，而是——允许自己什么都不做。\n\n我数过自己一年真正够格的进场机会，两只手数得完。\n\n其余的时间，我在做一件事，叫「等」：\n\n· 等一个大级别中枢真的走完，而不是在盘整里给自己硬编一个买点\n·","url":"https://x.com/InGodWeBelieveU/status/2110784423339630840"},{"author_id":"925446092669489154","created_at":"2026-10-15T20:02:08.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110823560256143550"],"id":"2110823560256143550","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":20,"like_count":0,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"大多数人亏在「想抓最低点」，而不是「等一个确定的点」。\n\n缠论里买卖点只有三类，排序的不是收益，是确定性：\n\n🔹 一买——赌背驰结束、左侧抄底。\n赔率最高，但你赌的是还没走完的结构，错了就是半山腰。\n\n🔹 二买——回抽不破前低。\n确定性高了一层，本质还在猜底。\n\n🔹","url":"https://x.com/InGodWeBelieveU/status/2110823560256143550"},{"article":{"title":"开拓者的香艳旅行，色鬼穹宝只是度假就约到淫熟魅女爻光？被大姐姐摁着榨到喊妈妈，最后再反杀(星穹铁道)"},"author_id":"2061924224626020352","created_at":"2026-10-15T14:14:28.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2110736065564643667"],"entities":{"urls":[{"display_url":"x.com/i/article/2110…","end":23,"expanded_url":"https://x.com/i/article/2110735759229571072","start":0,"status":404,"unwound_url":"https://x.com/i/article/2110735759229571072","url":"https://t.co/gxVi5YAqjd"}]},"id":"2110736065564643667","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":13527,"